                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Ministry of Health’s Drug Advisory Committee has not recommended insulin aspart (Fiasp) for inclusion on the MOH List of Subsidised Drugs for treating diabetes mellitus due to limited clinical need and unfavourable cost effectiveness compared with alternative treatments."
